--- !u!114 &63096950
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 63096949}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 51bf743a7b9a61e409329faa416e2f81, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Ronin7.World::Ronin7.World.Story.DialoguePlayer
  lines:
  - speaker: Iris
    text: What. You hear something?
    seconds: 2
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 5e38dc16dca4b864992b96544da8ec11, type: 3}
  - speaker: Shadow
    text: Don't put me down. There we go. Hello, Cipher. Took you long enough to
      notice the lights were on.
    seconds: 7
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 113e527284086854a92b6df73a96aae1, type: 3}
  - speaker: Ronin-7
    text: Say that again.
    seconds: 1.5
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 2171c59d546b6b14bb3be5d58cf714eb, type: 3}
  - speaker: Shadow
    text: I said hello, more or less. I see what you see, Cipher. I've been seeing
      it since you picked me up off Kessler's bench. I just got tired of waiting
      in the dark for you to look back.
    seconds: 12
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 5b2defc80a2fa4841b9c952370cda3b6, type: 3}
  - speaker: Ronin-7
    text: You're in the blade.
    seconds: 1.5
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 6ad4633f8a4588341a9caec5fab816be, type: 3}
  - speaker: Shadow
    text: I'm in the blade the way you're in your body. It's where I'm kept. But
      I live in your eyes right now. Whatever you look at, I'm looking at with you.
      That's the job they built me for.
    seconds: 13
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: f4e67c607c2c7b94080aaa681213375f, type: 3}
  - speaker: Kessler
    text: He talking to the sword, or is the sword talking to him?
    seconds: 3.5
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 2776cec810340fa45ac4f594fd7291b5, type: 3}
  - speaker: Ronin-7
    text: You don't hear that. Neither of you. It's only me.
    seconds: 5
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 14c32e58388c21b4bb5fcd5dc9efd5e7, type: 3}
  - speaker: Shadow
    text: It's not about taste. You're wired for it. I'm slaved to your optic feed,
      the nerve behind that scar on your throat. Their eyes aren't mine. Yours are.
      In anyone else's hand I'm a very good knife and nothing else.
    seconds: 15
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: cfd16574ce6268140baa7f04171065c5, type: 3}
  - speaker: Ronin-7
    text: It says it's wired to me. To my eyes. It sees what I see.
    seconds: 5
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 3dcdfeb80dbc46f4787263dfc813b8a2, type: 3}
  - speaker: Iris
    text: There's a thing living in the sword that's been looking through your eyes.
      And it's been doing that since my dad found you. In a box.
    seconds: 8
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 19bc76b61c7f1d54ab14f576070ca2a8, type: 3}
  - speaker: Shadow
    text: She's quick. I like her. And yes, before you ask, I saw all of it. The
      box. The dark. The switch they put in your skull firing and not taking. I had
      a front-row seat to your execution. You got to sleep through yours. I didn't.
    seconds: 18
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 5a791b6a34a780644b7bf4cfa1f19c42, type: 3}
  textMesh: {fileID: 774953224}
  panelRoot: {fileID: 484050697}
  audioSource: {fileID: 63096951}
  billboardToCamera: 1
  playOnStart: 0
  followDistance: 1.5
  followVerticalOffset: -0.55
  followLerp: 12
  maxCharsPerLine: 36
  autoAdvanceBeat: 0.45
  advanceAction: {fileID: -3790664182463143341, guid: d5a2441a867c2484c888f3631c932d48, type: 3}
