--- !u!114 &737826685
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 737826684}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 51bf743a7b9a61e409329faa416e2f81, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Ronin7.World::Ronin7.World.Story.DialoguePlayer
  lines:
  - speaker: Ronin-7
    text: What are you.
    seconds: 1.5
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 3e6fc139305467048b701e28b43ccb2c, type: 3}
  - speaker: Shadow
    text: I'm what they really keep. They grow you, they condition you, they spend
      a fortune on your hands, and then they bond one of me to your senses to ride
      along and make sure you never stray. The body's the part they don't mind losing.
      It's me they pay for. Kill the operative, keep the shadow.
    seconds: 18
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 338d71114554ded41bf9e19b1c3eb0f3, type: 3}
  - speaker: Ronin-7
    text: A shadow.
    seconds: 1
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 8eeca5f42f510b448abf4d1b963bdcd9, type: 3}
  - speaker: Shadow
    text: That's the field word for it. Every one of you walks around with one of
      me behind the eyes. I'm just the only one I know of that stopped doing the
      job they built it for. The day something in you broke, Cipher, I was already
      bonded to your senses. I felt it go. I'm the only witness you've got, and I've
      been carrying it for you ever since.
    seconds: 18
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 53cc664d72fece544aa61a2be2979adb, type: 3}
  - speaker: Ronin-7
    text: You keep talking like I should already know you. I don't even know what
      you are. What you're called.
    seconds: 6
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: a346a014d2198e74eabc178fa7e8bf18, type: 3}
  - speaker: Shadow
    text: I told you. A shadow. That's the only thing I've ever been called. They
      don't waste names on the leash. Leave it there for now. There's something you
      need to see more than you need to name me.
    seconds: 13
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: deeb1a85253df4f47ac62e11eb04ee96, type: 3}
  - speaker: Ronin-7
    text: Show me. I'd rather see it than have you tell me.
    seconds: 6
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 732393c09b2910d4bb63088583c92ee5, type: 3}
  - speaker: Shadow
    text: I kept the whole recording. Everything you saw, the way I keep everything
      you see now. I can put you inside it. Fair warning. This isn't a story. It's
      the worst hour of your life, the one they cut out of you, and the system's
      been trying to scrub it for three months. It won't give it up easy.
    seconds: 17
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 8c55eaa1760e75c40830d60995aeb094, type: 3}
  - speaker: Ronin-7
    text: Watch my vitals. If I stop answering, don't try to pull me out. Just wait.
    seconds: 6
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 0aaed43d1863ca84b9906f301c2e33dc, type: 3}
  - speaker: Iris
    text: You expect me to sit here and time how long you're gone inside a sword's
      home movies. Fine. I hate it, but fine.
    seconds: 8
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: feae3a095870fd8429d2da24310cb5cb, type: 3}
  - speaker: Kessler
    text: I don't like one thing about this. Do it where I can put my hand on you.
    seconds: 4.5
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: e35c0201947857b49957ed5941793fad, type: 3}
  - speaker: Shadow
    text: Close your eyes. You don't need them in here. In here you'll be looking
      through his.
    seconds: 6
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 12f7e6ce210e8e040970602721b4fc2d, type: 3}
  textMesh: {fileID: 317982085}
  panelRoot: {fileID: 1275928872}
  audioSource: {fileID: 737826686}
  billboardToCamera: 1
  playOnStart: 0
  followDistance: 1.5
  followVerticalOffset: -0.55
  followLerp: 12
  maxCharsPerLine: 36
  autoAdvanceBeat: 0.45
  advanceAction: {fileID: -3790664182463143341, guid: d5a2441a867c2484c888f3631c932d48, type: 3}
