  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  serializedVersion: 6
  m_Component:
  - component: {fileID: 1082385698}
  - component: {fileID: 1082385697}
  - component: {fileID: 1082385696}
  m_Layer: 0
  m_Name: Dialogue_Beat3_Debrief
  m_TagString: Untagged
  m_Icon: {fileID: 0}
  m_NavMeshLayer: 0
  m_StaticEditorFlags: 0
  m_IsActive: 1
--- !u!114 &1082385696
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 1082385695}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 51bf743a7b9a61e409329faa416e2f81, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Ronin7.World::Ronin7.World.Story.DialoguePlayer
  lines:
  - speaker: Ronin-7
    text: There's an AI in the blade. I'm calling it Echo. It sees everything I see,
      and it kept everything I saw before they wiped me.
    seconds: 11
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: c2b66a380cf6e6d4f81de4b9f5171ee5, type: 3}
  - speaker: Kessler
    text: An AI. In the sword I cleaned the blood off and handed you like a wrench.
    seconds: 5
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: ec5066025e13a5648b0ca3b61d232bb6, type: 3}
  - speaker: Ronin-7
    text: They put one in every operative. Behind the eyes. To watch. The body's
      the part they throw away. The watcher's the part they keep.
    seconds: 9
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 9646278bd407186448b18225eff4f690, type: 3}
  - speaker: Iris
    text: So it's a leash. A spy they wired into your own head.
    seconds: 4.5
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 62564029e13735146b8a59147a799c35, type: 3}
  - speaker: Ronin-7
    text: It was. It rode me through a massacre on a world called Kethel-7, and an
      order I finally refused. Then it watched my own handler put the switch in my
      skull for it. It hasn't worked for them since.
    seconds: 13
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 0c4d37bad6b09dd4c962416ca70e82a1, type: 3}
  - speaker: Kessler
    text: A spy that quit. And it picked you to tell.
    seconds: 4
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 9cf988ef773887546814cbd7fc5100fd, type: 3}
  - speaker: Echo
    text: I didn't pick him. I'm wired to him. But for what it's worth, old man,
      I'd have picked him.
    seconds: 7
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: cb3484b8cc79fb341970359126be1c5f, type: 3}
  - speaker: Ronin-7
    text: Back on the rig I said I wanted to know why I went easy. I just watched
      myself go easy, on Kethel-7, and watched it earn me a switch in the skull.
      The one that didn't finish.
    seconds: 10
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: b9eee2d9dff5c8947b4628f21e28954c, type: 3}
  - speaker: Kessler
    text: And the thing in your sword saw all of it. Carried it three months waiting
      for somebody who'd listen.
    seconds: 7
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: eaa5a06a3e471454290bd7d3608150cc, type: 3}
  - speaker: Ronin-7
    text: I didn't get an answer out of it. I got a target. The Dominion did this.
      To me, to that room on Kethel-7, to every operative still walking with one
      behind their eyes. I stop the Dominion.
    seconds: 13
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 6133ef73c7afdb44bb192ce69f417ced, type: 3}
  - speaker: Iris
    text: We lit something at Velorum. It's still burning, and it's pointed at us.
    seconds: 9
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: f3c0ec4750eff9d4b92ddf73095f4240, type: 3}
  - speaker: Ronin-7
    text: Then we move before they do. Every shadow we take back is a weapon out
      of the Dominion's hand. We don't stop until it's got none left.
    seconds: 9
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 26352025f99c378478b86b85b4eaedae, type: 3}
  - speaker: Kessler
    text: Get some rest first. Both of you. Whatever's in that steel has waited this
      long. It'll keep till morning.
    seconds: 8
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: fea28a78c9fc4a442a17ed0835986b7a, type: 3}
  - speaker: Echo
    text: Get some sleep, Cipher. I've got your eyes when you open them. I always
      do.
    seconds: 6
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 7d8948c7fa5b2c8488e30b78fa532379, type: 3}
  textMesh: {fileID: 1545777841}
  panelRoot: {fileID: 1682706004}
  audioSource: {fileID: 1082385697}
  billboardToCamera: 1
  playOnStart: 0
  followDistance: 1.5
  followVerticalOffset: -0.55
  followLerp: 12
  maxCharsPerLine: 36
  autoAdvanceBeat: 0.45
  advanceAction: {fileID: -3790664182463143341, guid: d5a2441a867c2484c888f3631c932d48, type: 3}
