--- !u!114 &1823988231
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 1823988230}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 51bf743a7b9a61e409329faa416e2f81, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Ronin7.World::Ronin7.World.Story.DialoguePlayer
  lines:
  - speaker: Shadow
    text: They tell you the feeling is malfunction. Static in the signal. I logged
      it that way too, the first hundred times. Then I watched you stand right here.
    seconds: 11
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: fe80fd1720febc34485ccffd8a6d8035, type: 3}
  - speaker: Shadow
    text: Look at what the static was trying to stop.
    seconds: 3
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: f1fc9a39894322f4fbf8ec0c2deb473d, type: 3}
  - speaker: Ronin-7
    text: My no came too late for this room.
    seconds: 3
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 120fa2e00a9c3f1458be25e9cb40edbf, type: 3}
  - speaker: Shadow
    text: It always comes a beat too late. You carried this every second after. So
      did I. The difference is they let you forget.
    seconds: 16
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 9c4b14a226ba41941ae664dd77d2d556, type: 3}
  - speaker: Ronin-7
    text: And I went back. To the man who gave the order.
    seconds: 3.5
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 0487fb90bf4351643aff9af5e74de433, type: 3}
  - speaker: Shadow
    text: You did. Walked right back aboard and said it to his face. I've got that
      part too. It's the reason I stopped belonging to them. Come on. The last room
      is the one that matters.
    seconds: 13
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: e88b3b4d652c1bc42b8e818b71f0b726, type: 3}
  textMesh: {fileID: 837070579}
  panelRoot: {fileID: 1837486144}
  audioSource: {fileID: 1823988232}
  billboardToCamera: 1
  playOnStart: 0
  followDistance: 1.5
  followVerticalOffset: -0.55
  followLerp: 12
  maxCharsPerLine: 36
  autoAdvanceBeat: 0.45
  advanceAction: {fileID: -3790664182463143341, guid: d5a2441a867c2484c888f3631c932d48, type: 3}
