--- !u!114 &1839937297
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 1839937296}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 51bf743a7b9a61e409329faa416e2f81, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Ronin7.World::Ronin7.World.Story.DialoguePlayer
  lines:
  - speaker: Shadow
    text: They tell you the feeling is malfunction. It's the only part of you that
      was ever telling the truth. You had it, on that floor. You still do.
    seconds: 11
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 9d2471116b4dfc147b90fb2bc9a1ac9f, type: 3}
  - speaker: Ronin-7
    text: They put that switch in me for it.
    seconds: 2
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 385e8dfc73547704aa2f5e481d2dd6ca, type: 3}
  - speaker: Shadow
    text: They did. It quit before it could finish you, and they couldn't kill me
      either. I'm the part they keep. And you were right that Khall couldn't look
      at you.
    seconds: 9
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 3f475a15a15fb1b43967261ac7002026, type: 3}
  - speaker: Shadow
    text: You were the first. You won't be the only one. But the others aren't the
      target. They're just the hands. The Dominion's the thing holding the knife.
    seconds: 14
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: d5f92ecf9da8d7d46835230295453c40, type: 3}
  textMesh: {fileID: 1607258644}
  panelRoot: {fileID: 262965068}
  audioSource: {fileID: 1839937298}
  billboardToCamera: 1
  playOnStart: 0
  followDistance: 1.5
  followVerticalOffset: -0.55
  followLerp: 12
  maxCharsPerLine: 36
  autoAdvanceBeat: 0.45
  advanceAction: {fileID: -3790664182463143341, guid: d5a2441a867c2484c888f3631c932d48, type: 3}
